  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Uniform WS Binary",
      "items": [
        "5 语言 SDK 输出同构 WS binary frame；服务端只认一个 frame codec"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "One Router",
      "items": [
        "P2PCommand Router（p2p-core 路由表）对 p2p-ws 与 UDP/QUIC/TCP 全部一致，Handler 不用分传输写"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Event Emitter",
      "items": [
        "所有 Handler 结果统一进入 Event Emitter 向外 onXxx 回调；Tracing 边车不进入 SDK 主热路径"
      ]
